        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/e480ec/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-07-03T01:55:20.864Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The defeat art for Reporter Alpha makes me think she was sitting at the table with the other pictured lady. Now, I do see the press pass, but between the set-up with what looks like a meal being thrown off doesn’t feel like an interview. Plus it feels odd to do an interview at an outdoor cafe. Between that and some vibes (oh so reliable, I know) from the art of the Insatiable Hunger aspect has myself and some of my friends are wondering if Tabitha is LGBTQ and the image shown on Reporter Alpha’s defeat side was a date. Does anybody know for sure?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-07-03T10:29:10.062Z",
